  "description": "Update a webhook. Updates an existing webhook configuration and event subscriptions. Use this to: - Modify webhook event subscriptions and triggers - Update webhook URL and endpoint configuration - Change authentication settings and credentials - Adjust custom headers and request parameters - Enable or disable specific webhook events Key information returned: - Success confirmation of webhook updates",
